flowchart TD
    Start([Install]) --> Lock[Acquire]
    Lock --> Recover[Recover shared journal]
    Recover --> Refresh[RefreshInstalled]
    Refresh --> ExplicitPlugin{显式规范 Plugin ref 且所选 Agent manifest 全部精确命中?}
    ExplicitPlugin -->|yes| ManifestHit[每个所选 Agent unchanged] --> Release
    ExplicitPlugin -->|no| List[Cloud List + resolve exact PowerRef]
    List --> Agent{next Agent}
    Agent --> Type{Power type}
    Type -->|Skill| SkillResolve[ResolveSkill + Config Find]
    SkillResolve --> SkillSame{same manifest version?}
    SkillSame -->|yes| Unchanged[unchanged]
    SkillSame -->|no| Cache[Cache PrepareSkill；hit 复验，miss 时私有目标 DownloadSkill 后原子发布 cache/staging]
    Cache --> FSTx[filesystem Install transaction]
    FSTx --> FSJournal[schema v1 driver=filesystem]

    Type -->|MCP| MCPResolve[ResolveMCP + Config Find]
    MCPResolve --> MCPInspect[Agent CLI Inspect]
    MCPInspect --> MCPState{manifest / presence / version}
    MCPState -->|same + present| Unchanged
    MCPState -->|no manifest + present| Fail[unmanaged conflict]
    MCPState -->|manifest + absent| MCPStale[InstallMCP nil definitions]
    MCPState -->|first absent| NewDef[Cloud GetMCP new]
    MCPState -->|update present| OldDef[Cloud GetMCP old] --> NewDef
    NewDef --> MCPTx[agent-cli InstallMCP transaction]
    MCPStale --> MCPTx
    MCPTx --> MCPJournal[schema v1 driver=agent-cli]
    MCPJournal --> Phases[removing-old / adding-new / committing / rolling-back]

    Type -->|Plugin| PluginManifest[Config Find target exact version]
    PluginManifest -->|same version| Unchanged
    PluginManifest -->|missing or different| PluginEnsure[Plugin Resource Ensure 共享 artifact；仅 miss 时 Cloud 下载 apc-plugin.json + skills，再派生 Agent 配置与双 marketplace]
    PluginEnsure --> PluginResolve[ResolvePlugin]
    PluginResolve --> PluginFacts[检查目标及旧版本的精确 Agent 事实]
    PluginFacts -->|Codex / Claude| PreviousLookup[Artifact MarketplaceFor；旧版本仅 Lookup，验证本地 marketplace/source 与逻辑 selector]
    PreviousLookup --> MarketplaceState{Codex / Claude manifest 与 marketplace 状态}
    MarketplaceState -->|no manifest + marketplace absent| MarketplaceFirst[首装 register source → add Plugin → manifest]
    MarketplaceState -->|no manifest + exact retained source| MarketplaceReinstall[重装 reuse source → add Plugin → manifest]
    MarketplaceState -->|previous manifest| MarketplaceSwitch[切换 remove old Plugin → unregister old source → register new source → add Plugin → manifest]
    MarketplaceReinstall -. commit / rollback / recovery .-> RetainedRecovery[不 unregister/register；仅方向已固定为 rolling-back 且 source 缺失时离线恢复]
    PluginFacts -->|Hermes / Bibit| FilesystemStage[事实完成后 Plugin Resource StageFilesystem] --> FilesystemPluginTx[逻辑名目录 filesystem Plugin transaction；Hermes CLI 激活，Bibit 无 Plugin CLI]
    MarketplaceFirst --> PluginJournal[schema v1 driver=plugin；每次 Agent 写操作前持久 phase]
    MarketplaceReinstall --> PluginJournal
    MarketplaceSwitch --> PluginJournal
    FilesystemPluginTx --> PluginJournal
    PluginFacts -->|部分、损坏或身份不符| PluginFail[fail closed；保留 manifest/artifact]

    FSJournal --> Outcome[installed/upgraded/downgraded]
    Phases --> Outcome
    PluginJournal --> Outcome
    Unchanged --> Agent
    Outcome --> Agent
    Fail --> Batch[fail-fast + remaining unexecuted]
    PluginFail --> Batch
    Agent -->|done| Release[Release then render]
    Batch --> Release
